%% 需求变更（CR-01）：候补入队与取消后的自动转正
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S1 as 学生A（已通过）
    actor S2 as 学生B（候补）
    participant RS as RegistrationService
    participant WP as WaitlistRegistrationPolicy
    participant CR as CapacityRule
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant EB as EventBus
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant WS as WaitlistPromotionService

    Note over S2,WP: 1. 名额已满时的候补入队
    S2->>RS: register(activity_id=5, studentB)
    RS->>WP: submit(context)
    WP->>CR: snapshot(activity, regs) → 2/2 已满
    WP-->>RS: PolicyDecision(status=waitlisted, queue_no=1)
    RS->>DB: INSERT registration(status=waitlisted, queue_no=1)
    RS->>EB: publish(RegistrationWaitlisted)
    EB->>NS: handle → 「已进入候补队列（第 1 位）」

    Note over S1,WS: 2. 有人取消 → 本服务作为第二个订阅者收到事件
    S1->>RS: cancel(reg_id=2)
    RS->>DB: UPDATE status=cancelled（提交事务）
    RS->>EB: publish(RegistrationCancelled)
    EB->>NS: handle → 通知学生A「报名已取消」
    EB->>WS: handle(RegistrationCancelled)
    WS->>CR: snapshot → 1/2（出现空位）
    WS->>DB: 取队列队首（queue_no 最小）
    WS->>DB: BEGIN → UPDATE status=approved<br/>remark=候补转正 → COMMIT
    WS->>EB: publish(RegistrationPromoted)
    EB->>NS: handle → 通知学生B「候补转正通知」+ 邮件
